=== 1. Storage of a density that changes without bound ===
partial_t Sigma: c
radial divergence of F: -c
balance residual: 0
Cesaro of partial_t Sigma: c
Cesaro of Sigma: oo
shell storage: 4*pi*c*(R**3 - a**3)/3
Cesaro of shell storage: 4*pi*c*(R**3 - a**3)/3
shell-content window average: 2*pi*c*(t0**2*(-R**3 + a**3) + (R**3 - a**3)*(T + t0)**2)/(3*T)
Cesaro of shell content: oo*sign(R**3 - a**3)
outer material flux Phi: 4*pi*(-R**3*c + 3*beta*t)/3
core channel: 4*pi*(a**3*c - 3*beta*t)/3
K + Phi + Jcore: 0
Cesaro of Phi: oo
Cesaro of Jcore: -oo
Cesaro of K+Phi+Jcore: 0
=== 2. Volume flux, two readings of the density condition ===
projected velocity: -R/(3*t) + beta/(R**2*c)
volume flux: -4*pi*R**3/(3*t) + 4*pi*beta/c
Cesaro of volume flux: 4*pi*beta/c
Sigma nonzero for every t>0: True
reading A prints volume flux (finite nonzero Cesaro of Sigma): False
reading A Cesaro of Sigma: oo
reading B prints volume flux (Sigma nonzero and Cesaro of V finite): True
reading B value: 4*pi*beta/c
Cesaro of F: oo
quotient of Cesaros F/Sigma: not a finite quotient; Cesaro of F and of Sigma are both infinite
=== 3. Product and quotient are not the images of the factors ===
product window average: (18*T + sin(2*t0) - sin(2*T + 2*t0) + 16*cos(t0) - 16*cos(T + t0))/(4*T)
Cesaro of n*u: 9/2
Cesaro of n: 2
Cesaro of u: 2
(Cesaro n)*(Cesaro u): 4
product difference: 1/2
Cesaro of 1/den: sqrt(3)/3
1/(Cesaro den): 1/2
quotient difference: -1/2 + sqrt(3)/3
=== 4. A fixed-frequency oscillation and the omega -> 0 family ===
finite-window average of A + B*cos(omega*t): (A*T*omega - B*sin(omega*t0) + B*sin(omega*(T + t0)))/(T*omega)
Cesaro at fixed nonzero omega: A
Cesaro of 4 + 7*cos(t): 4
omega -> 0 of the family at fixed t: A + B
Cesaro of that frozen family: 11
Cesaro of a constant storage rate c: c
storage removed by setting the time-rate term to zero: 0
=== 5. w-integral before the average keeps a moving face ===
projected density with a thickening face: s*t + 1
Cesaro of its time rate: s
same integral with the face frozen at t=0: 1
time rate of the frozen integral: 0
=== 6. Return, drain and face signs ===
return - drain + face - Schi: 0
return + drain + face - Schi: 2*nGamma_drain
sample Schi: 5
sample signed assembly: 5
sample all-positive assembly: 9
=== 7. Shell order-budget orientation ===
shell integral of the radial divergence: 4*pi*(R**2*H(R) - a**2*H(a))
outward outer + inward inner - divergence integral: 0
both outward minus divergence integral: 8*pi*a**2*H(a)
=== 8. t0 independence when the average exists ===
Cesaro of sin from t0: 0
same with t0 replaced by t0+7: 0
finite-window average of sin: (cos(t0) - cos(T + t0))/T
its T->oo limit: 0
